{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/3debb0ea25d034f3391f95b4c74eabd0.avif?t=1758235030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras_big/3debb0ea25d034f3391f95b4c74eabd0.avif?t=1758235030 width=800 height=355 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Cat Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Warfare is an arena shooter featuring fast-paced action and a classic multi-weapon arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/c2a9194cb758e4818cbd6603b4bcfe38.webp?t=1758235030\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture The Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cursed Capture The Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/e2c18fe07327c70dc96f4965600bb6cd.webp?t=1758235030\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your poison!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nail Gun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plasma Gun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Minigun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shotgun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rocket Launcher </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sniper Rifle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tesla Gun </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You chose the firepower to finish the fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span